/@GTO_Mason2/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e1d2359f/uploads/origins/f7c164ac-af65-4850-b73a-add5291f88b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76128f5a7af2550b16b1846ad1f9c852", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e1d2359f/uploads/origins/f7c164ac-af65-4850-b73a-add5291f88b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76128f5a7af2550b16b1846ad1f9c852, https://si.imgix.net/e1d2359f/uploads/origins/f7c164ac-af65-4850-b73a-add5291f88b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c53af54b1e1ed0a5fe57c0d6c079b926 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e1d2359f/uploads/origins/f7c164ac-af65-4850-b73a-add5291f88b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da421268b17efdfe91fd55640e737e3b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "おはようございます、ゴトー先生。\n\nドールズフロントラインのST AR-15の絵を依頼したいです。彼女が正面を眺めながら微笑む姿を描いてください。\n\n服装は添付サイトの画像でお願いします。\n\nhttps://gamepress.gg/girlsfrontline/sites/girlsfrontline/files/2020-05/ST_AR-15_Mod_N.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@GTO_Mason2/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/45eba1f3/uploads/origins/9f98e65b-1a4c-4e49-9c16-68e308e8828e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7887ac557b31f31dc63da036151403fe", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/45eba1f3/uploads/origins/9f98e65b-1a4c-4e49-9c16-68e308e8828e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7887ac557b31f31dc63da036151403fe, https://si.imgix.net/45eba1f3/uploads/origins/9f98e65b-1a4c-4e49-9c16-68e308e8828e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=883e4585dea384c62060726e3a0143b7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/45eba1f3/uploads/origins/9f98e65b-1a4c-4e49-9c16-68e308e8828e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=896d2778808a3c274eea1a29d7920e21 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, 